#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-ai:16
msgid ""
"Dagric local AI setup\n"
"=======================\n"
"This installs Ollama, a local large-language-model runner:\n"
"  * models run entirely on this computer (GPU-accelerated when available)\n"
"  * prompts and inference stay on this computer after a model is downloaded\n"
"  * installation and the first run need internet access to fetch Ollama and "
"a model\n"
"\n"
"What it changes on this machine:\n"
"  * installs the ollama binary and adds a system user for it\n"
"  * enables a restricted background service that starts at boot and listens\n"
"    only on this computer (127.0.0.1 port 11434)\n"
"  * downloaded models land in /usr/share/ollama and can be several GB each\n"
"\n"
"To remove it completely:\n"
"  sudo systemctl disable --now ollama\n"
"  sudo rm -f /usr/local/bin/ollama /etc/systemd/system/ollama.service\n"
"  sudo rm -rf /usr/local/lib/ollama /usr/share/ollama\n"
"  sudo userdel ollama\n"
msgstr ""

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-ai:44
